  (3, 'BNT-000103', '9781455586691', 'Deep Work', 'Cal Newport', 'Grand Central Publishing', 'Hardcover', 1, 'The ability to focus without distraction is becoming rare, which makes it valuable.', 'Computer science professor Cal Newport makes the case that long stretches of undistracted concentration produce the work that matters most. The first half explains why; the second gives rules for protecting focus in a world of notifications, meetings and open plan offices.', '# About this preview

