  (4, 'BNT-000104', '9780143130727', 'Ikigai', 'Héctor García and Francesc Miralles', 'Penguin Life', 'Hardcover', 1, 'What the long lived people of Okinawa can teach us about a reason to get up in the morning.', 'Two writers visit Ogimi, a Japanese village famous for its centenarians, and ask what keeps people active and content into old age. They find purpose, friendship, gentle movement, modest meals and work that never quite stops. A short, calm, illustrated read.', '# About this preview

