# What it is about

First published in 1989 and revised for its thirtieth anniversary, Covey\'s book sets out seven habits that move a person from dependence to independence to working well with others. It asks readers to start with character, not techniques.
---PAGE---
# Three ideas you will meet

Be proactive: act on what you can influence instead of reacting to what you cannot.

Begin with the end in mind, then put first things first by scheduling what is important before what is urgent.

Seek first to understand, then to be understood; real listening comes before persuading.
---PAGE---
# Is it for you?

For readers who want one thorough, structured book on personal effectiveness rather than many short ones.

