  (6, 'BNT-000106', '9781472139955', 'Mindset', 'Carol S. Dweck', 'Robinson', 'Paperback', 1, 'Why believing you can improve changes how much you actually do.', 'Stanford psychologist Carol Dweck summarises decades of research into two beliefs about ability. People with a fixed mindset see talent as set; people with a growth mindset see it as something built through effort. The difference shapes school, sport, work and relationships.', '# About this preview

