  (9, 'BNT-000109', '9780374533557', 'Thinking, Fast and Slow', 'Daniel Kahneman', 'Farrar, Straus and Giroux', 'Paperback', 2, 'A Nobel laureate\'s tour of the two systems in your head, and how often the fast one fools you.', 'Daniel Kahneman describes a quick, intuitive System 1 and a slow, effortful System 2. Through decades of experiments he shows how the fast system produces confident errors in judgement, from anchoring to overconfidence, and what little can be done about it.', '# About this preview

