  (10, 'BNT-000110', '9780804139298', 'Zero to One', 'Peter Thiel with Blake Masters', 'Crown Business', 'Hardcover', 2, 'Copying takes the world from one to many. Creating something new takes it from zero to one.', 'Based on a class Thiel taught at Stanford, this short book argues that the most valuable companies build something genuinely new instead of competing in crowded markets. It is opinionated, contrarian and full of questions founders should ask.', '# About this preview

